      <file>.claude/constraints/pcf.md</file>
      <file>.claude/patterns/ui/record-modal-selection.md</file>
      <file>docs/standards/MODAL-DECISION-CRITERIA.md</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-012-shared-component-library.md</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-021-fluent-design-system.md</file>
      <file>.claude/constraints/testing.md</file>
    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <notes>
    Steps 1-3 implemented on branch task/158-wizard-lookups (see notes/task-158-notes.md). Step 4 (deploy and dev check, including the stacking escalation trigger) is pending and belongs to the main session after merge.
    rework: none task 158
  </notes>
</task>
